(Svay Rieng): The Prosecutor of Svay Rieng Provincial Court has decided to charge Mao Vibol, a 37-year-old male resident of Thna Village, Kork Pring Commune, Svay Chrum District, Svay Rieng Province, with conspiracy and incitement to commit a crime. Pursuant to Articles 453, 494 and 495 of the Cambodian Penal Code.
The above allegations are related to the support and participation in the "coup attempt" plan to overthrow the Royal Government of Cambodia under the "Sam Rainsy plan to return to Cambodia" by appealing through His Facebook account and RFA interviews between August and September 2019.
