At present, new global tourism trends such as tourism, food, health and medical tourism, adventure tourism, religious tourism and self-driving tourism are creating more opportunities for young people as well as the general public. In capturing new skills and jobs, as well as creating more small and medium-sized businesses to meet the growing needs of these.
