Notably, youth are a source of innovation and contribution that contributes to strengthening the competitiveness of tourism.
Please be informed that in the last 20 years, after achieving peace, political stability, national security and national unity from all parties, Cambodia's tourism sector has proudly increased from just over 280,000 international tourists. From 1998 to 6.2 million in 2018 and created more than 620,000 direct jobs and tens of thousands more indirect jobs.
Currently, with high economic growth and rising people's incomes, Cambodia has also become a source of tourism market for the world, with more than 2 million Cambodians traveling abroad in 2018, an increase of 13.9. % Compared to 2017. This shows that the growth of one country also benefits other countries through tourism.
