This evening, Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit presided over the celebration of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, will preside over the celebration of the 70th Anniversary of September 25, 2019. Establish the People's Republic of China.
The event, held at the Diamond Island Center, will be hosted by the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, with the participation of senior officials of the Royal Government of Cambodia, as well as many other ambassadors and ambassadors from other countries to Cambodia. Also.
It should be noted that the People's Republic of China (Communist China) was established by Mao Zedong in Beijing on October 1, 1949, after overthrowing the Kuomintang government of Zhang Kai-shek and fleeing to form a government. Deportation in Taiwan.
Between 1949 and 1957, all agricultural land in China was organized by the communist government into collective property or placed under the collective control of the so-called "Solidarity Group". Production is cut to the state from 5% to 10%.
Urban economic activity was also brought under the control of the Communist Party, with all private enterprises being taken over by the communist government and all private business activities being outlawed. .
Any businessman who is willing to cooperate with the Communist Party is retained in the company only as a civil servant. Businessmen who refused to cooperate with the Communist Party faced punishment, and some were forced to abandon their homes and property by fleeing to Taiwan or Hong Kong.
The People's Republic of China for about 27 years under Mao Zedong with the use of economic policy, the plan did not make much progress in the country, many people have to live in poverty and poverty. Hungry.
A new era of prosperity of the People's Republic of China came after 1976. After President Mao Zedong died on September 9, 1976 at the age of 82, Teng Xiaoping was elected president.
Under the leadership of Teng Xiaoping, known as the Reformed Man, the regime changed its economy from a planned economy to a free market economy. With the reform of the economic regime, Teng Xiaoping developed the theory that "a cat, a black cat, as long as it catches a mouse, is a good cat", which means that the economic model of communism and liberalism is useful. To China, that is a good system.
Teng Xiaoping's prudent market regime decisions have helped China's economy grow steadily, rapidly emerge from poverty and become the world's second largest economy in a year. 2010 with a gross domestic product of nearly $ 6 trillion.
To this day, China continues to be the world's second largest economy with strong economic progress.
With this great development, the regime of the People's Republic of China has become a huge favorite of the Chinese people. In order to fulfill the aspirations of the Chinese people to live happily and promote China's development, the current Chinese President Xi Jinping, the seventh President of China, has launched his own internal reforms and put in place Issue more external policies, such as giant plans, belts and roads.
The People's Republic of China currently has an annual GDP of more than 14 trillion US dollars, while the per capita annual income is more than 10,000 US dollars.
