Please be informed that the Cambodian delegation has started its visit to Berlin. Prince Sar Kheng is scheduled to meet with representatives from the German Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the German Ministry of Interior and the Federal Parliament's International Development Affairs Committee. A panel of experts will make a scientific presentation on the experience and technical strategies of the German decentralization and sub-national administration in front of the Cambodian delegation.
