Samdech Heng Samrin mentions the active role of the National Assembly of Cambodia in the field of parliamentary diplomacy
(Phnom Penh): In his address to the 4th Asia-Europe Parliamentary Assembly Presidential Meeting in the Republic of Kazakhstan, Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly of Cambodia, highlighted the active role of the National Assembly of Cambodia in the field of parliamentary diplomacy.
He stressed that the role of the Cambodian Parliament in international forums and participation in building peace with the world over the past few years, the Cambodian Parliament has hosted a number of inter-parliamentary forums, including the ASEAN Inter-Parliamentary Forum, the Asia Regional Parliament Of French-speaking countries and the Asia-Pacific Parliamentary Forum.
These activities reflect the role of parliamentary diplomacy and the significant contribution of Cambodia, with the issuance of key resolutions and declarations focused on resolving issues that benefit all stakeholders, preventing the spread of defensive operations. Which is a driving force behind global trade, investment and environmental growth.
The 4th Asia-Europe Parliamentary Assembly Meeting was held under the theme "Higher Excellence for Eurasia: Dialogue, Confidence and Partnership". The meeting will be held from September 23 to 25, 2019, with the participation of parliamentary leaders from about 60 countries in Asia and Europe, as well as the presence of international organizations and inter-parliamentary organizations.
In the same speech, Samdech Heng Samrin added that in 2020, Cambodia will host the Asia-Europe Summit and the Asia-Europe Parliamentary Partnership Meeting with more than 50 member countries. The forum will provide a good opportunity for all members to discuss global challenges and find common solutions, as well as strengthen partnerships to achieve better and more prosperous member countries and the world.
Cambodia has embraced change and continued its reforms to achieve sustainable and environmental development. Deepening internal reform and increasing external friends is a national strategic policy.
Samdech stressed that after Cambodia achieved full peace and political stability in the late 1990s, Cambodia has achieved remarkable achievements in the reconstruction, construction and development of the nation with rapid growth and prestige on the international stage. . Cambodia developed from a poor country to a low middle income country by 2015 and a high middle income country by 2030.
The National Assembly President said that Cambodia used to be a host country of the United Nations peacekeeping force, now becoming a country that sends its forces to contribute to peacekeeping under the United Nations umbrella, which so far Cambodia has sent More than 6,000 troops go to conflict areas around the world.
Please be informed that the Asia-Europe Parliamentary Assembly Meeting, initiated by the Duma of the Russian Federation and the National Assembly of the Republic of Korea, is an important inter-parliamentary forum for discussions on the topic of cooperation between the representatives of the peoples of Asia and Europe. To exchange views on safeguarding the interests of sustainable development and social welfare in the region as well as the world.
The first Asia-Europe Parliamentary Assembly level meeting was held in Russia in 2016, the second in the Republic of Korea in 2017 and the third in Turkey in 2018.
