Lt. Gen. Hun Manet emphasized that "our army has ended the civil war and we are united in building the country, defending the territorial integrity and safeguarding internal peace." Here are the virtues: Uncle's experience and example to pass on to the next generation. "Even though Uncle Ming finished his work as a force, Uncle Ming is a national resource."
Mr. HUN Manet added that the gathering and promotion of retired soldiers now is in order to thank the merits, achievements and efforts to fulfill the duties of the motherland, especially in the difficult period of national liberation and Maintain peace and achieve a win-win strategy and make us as peaceful as we are today.
He stressed that without the participation of veterans and all political forces involved, Cambodia would not have been able to achieve a win-win strategy. On the other hand, this gathering is to congratulate the veterans who have been promoted by the King, the Royal Government and the Ministry of National Defense, which is historic for the Cambodian army to be equipped before the retirement.
