She said that as a rule, before going out to the market to learn makeup skills with her sister in the market, she always buys green tea, echinacea, lemon tea, honey from her mother, who sells groceries in the village to eat when Scream. Earlier this week, before going to the market, you bought Echitan green tea as usual, but when you fold the lid of the bottle with your children who have a husband nearby, you will see a prize of 100 million riels in the bottle cap.
