Currently, the district police force together with the district military force sent the five victims to the Kampong Seila District Referral Hospital in Preah Sihanouk Province, while the exhibits of both vehicles were kept at the Police Inspectorate of Kampong Seila District, Preah Sihanouk Province. Waiting to be resolved according to the road traffic law.
