For the Kan Ben Pchum Ben Festival 2029, it will take place from the 1st of Roach to the 14th of Roach, which is the 14th to the 27th of September 2019. According to the historical records of Cambodia, the Pchum Ben festival has existed since ancient times. But honestly, in the past it was not called Bon Pchum, in this ceremony they are divided into two classes.
In ancient times, this festival was held to prepare monks for the rainy season in the pagoda for three months from the day of the rainy season to the day of the rainy season. According to ancient records, during the rainy season, heavy rains make it difficult for monks to roam. That is why the Buddhists organize this ceremony to supply the monks daily until the rainy day.
On the other hand, in this festival, it is held to spread the devotion to the ghosts, relatives and relatives of the seven clans, as well as many great relatives, through the power of the monks who live and suffer as ghosts. There are those who are severely punished, suffer from hunger, and all of them have escaped from the hardships of sorrow. Today, the Ministry of Interior conducts the 2019 Civil Servants Recruitment Examination Nationwide
