(Kampong Cham): In a ceremony to equip soldiers to retire in 2019 in the 2nd Army Zone, Kampong Cham Province, on September 21, 2019, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Army confirmed. That the Royal Government has never forgotten the merits of the previous generation of soldiers who participated in saving the nation and maintaining peace.
