Letter to readers: Sam Rainsy, a traitor, a traitor to the throne and a terrorist leader, is implementing a legitimate coup d'etat plan to change the regime clearly
(Phnom Penh): The traitor Sam Rainsy has always been committed to planning a war in Cambodia. From the beginning, the traitor Sam Rainsy was not a politician who respected the laws of the nation and never respected democracy by competing through Vote too. This traitor always incites innocent Cambodians to overthrow the government that emerged from the election when he lost the election until he committed an illegal crime and fled abroad.
Lately, the traitor Sam Rainsy has become more ruthless and evil, even daring to insult the power of the Khmer King by using inappropriate words to the King, the most respected of the Cambodian people.
The actions of the traitor Sam Rainsy Through these words, the convict Sam Rainsy is committing more and more serious crimes that can not be forgiven. The traitor who inherited the reputation of treason from his father, Sam Sary, is known as a foreign political tool against Norodom Sihanouk, the former head of state of the Sangkum era.
Sam Rainsy is still angry with his traitorous father, and what Sam Rainsy is doing is destroying the whole of Cambodia, the nation, the religion, the King, under the pretext of loving democracy and human rights.
Not only is there a plan to overthrow the legitimate government, which is maintaining peace and development, now the traitor Sam Rainsy is evolving into a terrorist master, because by his conviction that he will mobilize Money for the army to secede and hand over to the Royal Government.
The question is: Which politician in the world who opposes with weapons and separatists is a democratic and democratic politician?
The answer is not democracy, it is the rebels or terrorists that the world hates and is blocking.
Therefore, the plans of the traitors Sam Rainsy clearly show that they have gone beyond the overthrow of the Royal Government of Cambodia, and there are even plans to overthrow the monarchy in the sense of changing the monarchy by means of the main rebels. Terrorists lure innocent people to join them.
The question is: How can a peaceful regime change with the King as a cool shadow for the Cambodian people? How did Sam Rainsy change?
The answer is clearly no different from Lon Nol: a bloody coup. Khmer history is a country with a high civilization, glorious from the beginning, Cambodia has adopted the only political regime, the Cambodian monarchy has a king since ancient times, so the traitor Sam Rainsy is very brave. Betrayed the spirits of all former Khmer kings.
The question is: Do Cambodians need more war and bloodshed?
The answer is definitely not needed because war is not profitable, as Cambodia has just developed, its people are living peacefully, working, studying, benefiting from national prosperity and peace.
The Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Prime Minister Hun Sen, has taken an absolute and unwavering stand and, at all costs, defends the monarchy based on the Constitution, the Royal Throne and the national motto, religion, and the King.
In conclusion, all those involved in the traitorous convict Sam Rainsy, who is having the worst plans for Cambodia, please withdraw immediately to avoid being deceived by this convict's ideology, otherwise it will be legal for both the planner and the accomplice. Thoughts are guilty and can not be forgiven.
