Not only foreign tour guides, but also local tour operators have been citing delays in providing services for visitors at the gate. The tour guide said that not only the border gates with neighboring countries, even the Siem Reap International Airport is no different for this service.
Both Myo Set and local tour guides want to see a change and change in the attitude of border guards, both by land and by air, in an effort to provide services as soon as possible. Showing a welcoming smile is also a heartfelt welcome for guests.
