Mr. Kong Vibol added that the new building has a height of 32 floors, with a total construction area of 97,700 square meters will contribute to enhance the beauty and become a landmark (Landmark) of Phnom Penh and the Kingdom of Cambodia. As a symbol of the progress of the internal economy of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
