During the visit, Lt. Gen. Yuthea stated the following objectives:
* First: Understand the work activities and roles and responsibilities of the Customs and Immigration Police Unit at the border gates between Cambodia and Thailand * Second: Promote and strengthen mechanisms to control the illegal movement of drugs and chemicals across the border * Third : Promote and promote good cooperation of law enforcement officers in the border area, especially cooperation with the Thai side * Fourth: Strengthen drug control cooperation across the Cambodian-Thai border.
