Workers' minimum wage for 2020 to be approved tomorrow morning
Mr. Som Oun confirmed that on the afternoon of September 18, 2019, the National Minimum Wage Council met for more than 5 hours until 7 pm, and on the morning of September 20, 2019, the National Wage Council will meet tomorrow. Final approval.
