The Secretary of State strongly hoped that after the election of Pailin Chamber of Commerce, the trade volume in the province will be doubled, which will be convenient for business owners as well as the people, especially in order to facilitate the level. The living standard of the people in Pailin province as well as throughout the country will be improved to another level.
