The policy on the vision of higher education 2030 and the roadmap for higher education in 2015-2030 and in the future set the path for the development of the education sector to achieve the four basic goals, including: 1: Quality and relevance, 2: Accessibility Learning and equity, 3: Internationalization and localization and 4: Governance and autonomy.
