Reports from Mondulkiri province and this senior police officer of the Mondulkiri Provincial Police revealed that Lieutenant Colonel Samrith Noy, chief of the Double Nam Lear checkpoint, opened to 300 to 400 Vietnamese a day. Using illegal cross-border tourist vehicles to enter the illegal gambling area in illegal casinos every day.
