During the closing ceremony on September 12, Mondulkiri Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Lor Sokha told Fresh News that there is no license for casinos at the Nalea border crossing, so it is necessary to apply for a permit. Will be reopened, but if it is found that there is a law and steals online gambling, contrary to the decision of the Prime Minister and illegally open the law, his police force will take strict action.
Separately, for the casino at the Dak Dam bilateral checkpoint, the General Commissioner claimed that after the inspection, there was a permit, but the wrong location, which means that the casino is located at a distance of nearly 20 km from the border, but in the permit. To be done next to the border, and especially that the casino allows Cambodians to visit.
