Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated: "Among Cambodia, Laos, Myanmar, Thailand and Vietnam, Thailand is the country that receives the most workers from Cambodia, from Myanmar and from Laos because there are jobs and things. This is related. "For example, if all three countries send out workers from these three countries, the Thai economy could fall sharply due to a lack of manpower."
