Minister Veng Sakhon expressed his deep gratitude to the Australian Government and people for their continued support for Cambodia's development. In the field of agriculture, the Australian Government has also provided significant cooperation through the implementation of a number of projects, particularly the Cambodian Agricultural Value Chain (CAVAC) project, which has been involved in the implementation of agricultural development policies and plans. Of the Ministry effectively.
