Minister of Water Resources inspects the flow of water at the bridge over National Road 6, an important waterway related to the slow or fast flow into the Tonle Sap
(Kampong Cham): On the afternoon of September 14, 2019, Mr. Lim Kean Hor, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology, accompanied by Mr. Mao Hak and his colleagues, inspected the actual flow of water at the bridge along National Road 6. It is an important waterway related to the slow or fast receding of the flood from above, especially in Kampong Cham province.
Officials from the Ministry of Water Resources confirmed that the actual inspection showed that the water flow decreased slowly and less than before at a height of about 1 meter.
