In addition, there are many other humanitarian and social activities that the 3rd Border Protection Battalion has achieved. Taking this opportunity to alleviate the hardships that the battalion is facing, the lieutenant general asked the Minister to help build a 537-meter-long concrete road and replace 28 sets of 250-amp solar panels.
