(Kratie): The Cambodian Red Cross, chaired by Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, this morning, September 13, 2019, assigned a team from the Cambodian Red Cross Headquarters to bring humanitarian aid to the victims. Flooding of 359 families living in Chhlong and Chet Borey districts, Kratie province.
