The United Nations Children's Fund (UNICEF) has donated five motorcycles to officials of the five target social affairs departments through the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, in the presence of Mr. Nim Thoth, Secretary of State, Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation on September 13, 2019.
