(Kratie): In response to the hardships and actual needs of the people affected by the Mekong River flood who evacuated to the safety of Senior Minister Kun Kim on the morning of September 12, 2019, continued the visit and distribution Assistance to the people at Wat Bos Leav and the Red Cross sub-branch of Kratie city, both locations, a total of 623 families were evacuated from Chit Borei district and Kratie city.
