(Phnom Penh): Russey Keo District Administration announces the last notification to the traders to cooperate in preparing the corrugated iron flooring, the entrance and exit of their respective business locations and houses, especially the dismantling of all equipment and exhibits. From the side of the road after the district administration has informed many times in the past to improve the beauty of Phnom Penh.
