This statement was made by Senior Minister Ieng Moly as he presided over the opening ceremony of the workshop on the validation of the 5th Comprehensive National Strategic Plan and Multilateral Comprehensive HIV / AIDS Response Plan for 2019. - 2023 in the morning of September 10, 2019 at the Le Royal Hotel.
The purpose of the workshop was to gather input from representatives of all relevant ministries, institutions and sectors, both national and sub-national, on a comprehensive and comprehensive draft of a comprehensive national strategic plan and multi-sectoral HIV response. And the fifth HIV / AIDS for 2019-2023, which will be used to address the problem of HIV / AIDS epidemic and response for the next five years.
Senior Minister Ieng Moly added that Cambodia has come a long way in the fight against the HIV epidemic. Strong intentions, accompanied by clear joint efforts with the contribution of people living with HIV, affected people and civil society organizations, have pushed us to fight the spread of HIV.
