Man stabbed to death by strangers while being taken to hospital
(Phnom Penh): A man died while being taken to the hospital while being stabbed several times by a stranger.
The incident took place in an apartment building in Kbal Damrey village, Sangkat Kakap II, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Residents immediately called for an ambulance to take them to the hospital, but because the victim was bleeding too much, it was difficult to rescue, causing the victim to die. Pity.
After the incident, the local police arrived and contacted the forensic experts to inspect the body to make a record and hand over the body to the family to take to the traditional ceremony. Separately, the suspects are being investigated by the competent authorities and will be arrested and punished according to the law.
Women worry about easy ways to keep fit
(Phnom Penh): Marriage is a natural thing for a woman, but after giving birth, she gains weight and loses her shape, which is why some women decide to use contraception. For some, it takes time to save money.
Therefore, women often choose contraception to save time to take care of the body and save some money. However, there are so many types of birth control that it can be difficult for users to decide which one to take. However, you should consult with your doctor before deciding which method of birth control is best for your health.
Obviously, you can try the new generation contraceptive pill, Eva, because it is easy to use, affordable and a product from Europe with less side effects, especially not to gain weight, make women more confident.
