(Phnom Penh): On the morning of September 10, 2019, the National Assembly of Cambodia convened a meeting of the Standing Committee chaired by Samdech Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, to review a number of proposals and agendas.
1. Examination of the request for approval of the draft law on the approval of the second protocol on the demarcation of the transit border gate of the ASEAN Framework Agreement on the Coordination of Transit of Goods.
2. Examination of the request for approval of the Draft Law on the Approval of the Agreement between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region of the People's Republic of China on the Avoidance of Double Taxation and the Prevention of Fraud Taxes relate to income tax.
3. Examination of the request for approval of the draft law on construction.
4: Examination of the request to include in the agenda of the 3rd session of the National Assembly, 6th legislature: the draft law on e-commerce, the draft law on consumer protection and the draft law on the approval of the agreement between The Kingdom of Cambodia and the Organization for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons on the Privileges and Immunities of the Organization for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons.
