Drunk, please do not drive! 4 killed and 28 injured in traffic accidents nationwide on September 9 yesterday
(Phnom Penh): According to the report from the General Commission of the National Police, on September 9, 2019, there were 13 traffic accidents nationwide, resulting in 4 deaths, 7 minor injuries and 21 serious injuries. .
According to the same source, in these 13 accidents, 15 motorcycles, 8 cars, 2 trucks and 1 other vehicle were damaged and the causes of the accidents were: speed Disrespectful, disrespectful, competitive, dangerous and drunk.
During the nine days from September 1 to 9, 2019, there were 97 traffic accidents, resulting in 51 deaths, 91 serious injuries and 38 minor injuries.
