(Kep): Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, has appointed 34 members of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Kep for the fifth mandate, which was held at the opening ceremony of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch in Kep. 5th mandate (2019-2025) in the morning of September 9, 2019 at Kep Provincial Hall.
