(Phnom Penh): Nationwide Traffic Law Enforcement Campaign For September 9, 2019, the traffic police force inspected 1,136 vehicles and found 1,066 vehicles in violation of the law, including motorcycles. 867 units. This is according to the official report of the General Commission of the National Police.
For the results of the 9-day inspection from September 1 to 9, 2019, the police inspected 24,756 vehicles and found 14,152 vehicles, including 11,434 motorcycles. And fined 13,187 units, including 10,804 motorcycles. Campaign to prevent child labor in brick production continues to reach 50 more locations in Kampong Cham, Tbong Khmum and Kratie
(Kampong Cham): The campaign to prevent the use of child labor in the field of brick production continues to implement strict measures and visited Kampong Cham, Tbong Khmum and Kratie provinces to improve the implementation of labor laws and the campaign of the community to produce bricks without child labor in 2020.
The campaign in the three provinces has reached 50 brick handicraft sites since September 2, 2019.
Mr. Veng Heang, Director of the Department of Child Labor of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training, led a working group to prevent the use of child labor in the field of brick-making handicrafts, informing about the progress of working conditions, including:
* Awareness of preventing the use of child labor among employers, workers, families and communities in the field of brick making has improved significantly compared to 2016.
* All brick-and-mortar handicrafts do not use child labor, and about 10 percent of employers have a ban on the use of children under the age of 15.
* All handicrafts use environmentally friendly firewood.
* No debt deductions, no freedoms, no forced labor and no debt bondage or debt traps.
* The brick making machine is not yet automatic.
During the campaign, employers and the entire brick-making community are committed to educating children on skills training and preventing occupational accidents, as well as the use of child labor in brick-making.
