On this issue, Mrs. Lon Lon asked for the intervention to find responsibility and give her justice as the Kampong Cham Provincial Court issued a verdict to break the land use right (legal chicken wings) and plan to dismantle The stall on the roadside land (outside his land) to the plaintiff using a forged letter.
