Please note that the recruitment exam for the Ministry of Mines and Energy in 2019 is the fourth recruitment of civil servants for the Ministry of Mines and Energy, which has three exam subjects in 2019, such as general culture. General English and technical subjects, and the technical subjects focus on public administration, law, economics, accounting, banking and finance.
