(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, on the morning of September 7, 2019, stopped the traffic on the Tuol Roka Bridge in Dey Leu Village, Peam Koh Sna Commune, Stung Trang District after the bridge collapsed. Yesterday, after being threatened by floods.
