Ministry of Commerce Holds Trade Facilitation Training for Trade Department Officials, Staff, Institutions and Students in Tbong Khmum Province
(Tbong Khmum): In order to increase the knowledge of the development in the field of business to the officials of the Department of Commerce, staff, institutions and students in Tbong Khmum, the Ministry of Commerce in cooperation with the provincial authorities under the organization of the Tbong Khmum Provincial Department of Commerce held a training course on Trade facilitation.
The above training course was organized under the chairmanship of Mr. Reach Ra, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Commerce and Mr. Cheng Bunnara, Deputy Governor of Tbong Khmum Province. This training course was held at Heng Samrin University, Tbong Khmum this morning, September 4, 2019.
