(Kandal): As a regular attention and to strengthen the safety of food quality and food that is circulating in the market to the people this morning, September 4, 2019, CamControl Kandal Branch in collaboration with the Department of Commerce. Kandal Provincial Committee together with district authorities and market commission inspected the quality of goods circulating in Koki market, Kien Svay district, Kandal province.
