(Pursat): CamControl Branch, Pursat Province, in cooperation with officials of the Department of Commerce and the Director General of CamControl, this morning, September 3, 2019, brought a mobile test vehicle of General Department of CamControl to inspect the quality, quantity and price at each station. And a gas station in Bakan district.
