(Kampong Chhnang): A factory worker named Sok Kea, 35 years old, living in Oknha Pang village, Longvek commune, Kampong Tralach district, Kampong Chhnang province, currently working as a garment factory worker, was lucky to win 100 million Riels from Echitan green tea after using her child. Her 8-year-old son went to buy and eat.
Ms. Sokea described to the team that handed over the grand prize to the house that now the standard of living of her family is not very comfortable because there are only two factory workers, a couple and a little farm for his livelihood. Daily family only.
She added that to win 100 million Riel from Echitan green tea now, she can hardly believe her eyes, because every day when going to work in the factory, she always buys Echitan green tea to eat regularly. Because it can help quench thirst and help to be strong, but only one bottle is rewarded.
Last weekend, after returning from work, she used her son to buy pomegranate-flavored echinacea tea to eat, and when she turned the bottle cap, she found a prize of 100 million riels. Suddenly, she did not seem to believe her eyes and called the neighbors and her husband to check, only to find out that she really won 100 million Riel, and also called the company through the existing phone number. Bottle cap only.
Ms. Sokea stated that the prize money of 100 million Riel is very important for the family and after receiving the prize money of 100 million Riel, she will take some to pay off debts and leave some to support their children's education and Create a business to solve family life in the future.
