(Kampong Cham): The Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, together with the authorities of Kampong Siem District, on September 3, 2019, rescued 5 families who suffered from river bank collapse in Moan Heur Village, Han Chey Commune, Kampong Siem District, Kampong Cham Province. Kampong Cham.
