(Phnom Penh): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries and Chairman of the Agricultural Production Contract Coordination Committee, on September 2, 2019, chaired a meeting to review and discuss the progress report, challenges and implementation directions. Continuing on contract agricultural production for the first half of 2019.
