5G is the fifth generation of mobile technology, it is designed to increase power, speed, reduce downtime and wireless capabilities.
Depending on the advantages of this new technology, 5G can help improve our daily life with the following benefits:
Provide more complete welfare services: Get advice and advice from doctors online, monitor health status through online wearables and remote surgery.
* Increase safety and reduce traffic congestion: All vehicles can connect to each other and connect to the transport network management system, use motion sensors to avoid accidents and update the road map.
* Increase living comfortably and stably: Your home, including all internal technology devices, can be remotely controlled, easy to control lighting and security.
