It is the first step for Metfone to set up the first and only 5G booth in Phnom Penh.
As a leading provider of information and communication technology (ICT), Metfone is responsible for creating the most comprehensive infrastructure for building a digital society in Cambodia.
It is not just a telecommunications company, but a network of remote computer network management, Internet of Things (IoT) and other digital services.
Metfone aims to provide affordable prices and nationwide coverage for all customers in the Kingdom of Cambodia with the ambition to promote the development of Cambodia to the top level in the world of telecommunications and ICT technology.
