To save Cambodia, they need to raise a lot of money from Cambodians abroad. Such scams have been used by Sam Rainsy and his associates for decades. But this deceptive policy has been causing the overwhelming majority of Cambodians, both inside and outside the country, to lose faith, which has pushed Sam Rainsy to become increasingly isolated.
People now live in reality, not believe in fiction. This is also the most important reason why the Cambodian people have always given justice to the party led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen for 40 years and will continue to give justice to those who live in reality for a long time to come.
