Minister of Education: Teaching young children to know the national language clearly is the most necessary foundation to make them successful in life
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, reminded all parents that teaching young children to know their national language more clearly is the most necessary foundation for learning international languages. More precisely, a vehicle makes them successful in life.
Mr. Hang Chuon Narong made this remark when he presided over the graduation ceremony of primary and secondary education and commendation letter for the best students of 2019 of True Vision International School of Cambodia at Le Royal Hotel. Phnom Penh.
Mr. Hang Chuon Narong stated that the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports has made efforts to improve the quality of education through the implementation of various reforms, including exam reform, improving the teaching methods at the primary level, especially the focus on Educate young children because the foundation of education is to start with young children and take care of the baby in the womb to grow well both physically and mentally.
He said that so if young children go to school and go through kindergarten and primary school, which makes children knowledge and get a good foundation. As a school today, some young children of Cambodia have been trained in national and international language knowledge at True Vision Cambodia International School to acquire skills at this basic level as well.
The Minister stressed that on behalf of all parents, it is important to pay attention to teaching the national language as well as foreign languages, especially to participate in the field of education for young children in terms of knowledge, behavior and to cooperate with foreign educational institutions is also important. Very much because now we all live in the fourth industrial revolution era of the use of technology as well.
Mr. Seng Bona continued that the establishment of a school, a community is intended for all parents to actively participate in teaching their children at home and monitor all the shortcomings of the school or them. Want a new program, they can all come to the school education office to discuss common goals to train young children to be more quality.
The teacher stated that what True Vision Cambodia International School wants is based on only one point, "quality", but the word quality is easy to say, but there are many factors to do so far. The school is very much supported by the parents of the students in terms of the quality of education.
According to Khim Sokheng, a student guardian at True Vision International School, as a parent who has given birth to a child and cared for him, he clearly sees the value of education. Therefore, as a parent, he has made every effort to develop his children to become good children, good citizens, and good leaders to represent our Cambodian identity and society.
