(Kratie): A joint force led by Mr. Oung Sambit, Deputy Governor of Chit Borey District, on August 31, 2019, continued to crack down on fisheries crimes in Boeung Chralompok and Boeung Tranol Chhnang in Krakor Sangkat, Kratie City and Thmor Kre Commune. Chit Borey district, Kratie province, by confiscating many artefacts.
