Senior Minister Osman Hassan Meets Sri Lankan Minister of Planning
(Sri Lanka): Mr. Osman Hassan, Senior Minister in charge of Special Missions, continued to lead the Cambodian delegation to meet with Mr. Rauff Hakeem, Minister of Urban Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education.
The meeting took place at the Ministry of Urban Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education of the Socialist Democratic Republic of Sri Lanka on the morning of August 28, 2019.
In this discussion, Senior Minister Osman Hassan said that although Cambodia is a Buddhist country with 93% of its people, but the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister. To all Cambodians of different religions.
Among them are Muslims, who make up about 5 percent. In addition, the Royal Government has provided opportunities for the Muslim community in Cambodia to have the opportunity to serve as civil servants at both the national and sub-national levels in almost all ministries and institutions.
