According to Sar Kheng, after the Law on Associations and Non-Governmental Organizations was promulgated, local associations and non-governmental organizations applied for registration with the Ministry of Interior in accordance with the Law on Associations and Non-Governmental Organizations. Yes, a total of 838 governments, including 406 associations and 432 NGOs.
However, the head of the Ministry of Interior also pointed out that 81 associations and non-governmental organizations have been removed from the list at the Ministry of Interior at the request of the concerned associations and non-governmental organizations. Despite the delisting from the Ministry of Interior, the number of new local associations and NGOs on a monthly basis has not diminished, as some have expressed concern.
