Kampong Speu Provincial Governor Inspects Water Pumping for Farmers, Transplanting and Distributing Diesel Oil for Owners
(Kampong Speu): On the afternoon of August 27, 2019, Mr. Vy Samnang, Governor of Kampong Speu Province and his team inspected the location of pumping stations for farmers in the province and distributed diesel. Directly in the field to encourage the cultivation of rice.
According to the figures of the Department of Water Resources throughout Kampong Speu province, there are 10 water pumps to save rice and people's water, as well as to rehabilitate many main canals for irrigating rice fields far away.
Mr. Vy Samnang informed the farmers that the provincial administration has urged professional officers to continue to monitor the irrigation water regularly. At the same time, diesel was distributed to the rice fields and continued to visit all bases throughout the province to grasp the shortage of water for growing crops.
The governor also stated that the department must continue to pay attention to farmers who depend on agriculture to ensure the use of water and educate them on how to grow crops to get high yields, including that they understand the use of drugs and Proper fertilizer of agriculture to avoid affecting the health of farmers.
