(Phnom Penh): A man was shot dead by an unknown gunman while riding a motorcycle back home near my opportunity center. This shocking incident happened at more than 11 pm on August 27, 2019, located along the concrete road near the Opportunity I in Samrong village, Khmuonh commune, Sen Sok district, Phnom Penh.
The victim's wife said that before the incident, her husband went to a friend's party, and at around 11 pm, someone called to tell him that he had been shot by three explosions. The bullet died instantly. And then she could not believe that her husband had been shot. Suddenly, she went to the above location and found that her husband had been shot and killed.
Sen Sok District Police Inspector Hour Meng Wang told Fresh News this morning, August 28, 2019, that the exact cause of this case is not yet known. The Khan Police Inspectorate and the specialized authority of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police under the direction of Lt. Gen. Thet are conducting a thorough investigation.
