Black oil truck met with a traffic accident on National Road 4, Kampong Speu province, causing oil to flow on the road, the authorities temporarily stopped traffic
(Kampong Speu): A black oil truck collided with a stone truck at km 103-104 on National Road 4 in Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province this morning, August 28, 2019, but did not cause Let no one suffer.
Kampong Speu Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Sam Samoun told Fresh News that although the accident did not cause any casualties, a black tanker truck leaked a tank, causing oil to flow all over the road, making it impossible for other vehicles. Do the traffic.
To avoid further accidents, he decided to temporarily suspend traffic and sent two fire trucks to clear the road in the area, he said.
